  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraq - Economic Inequality Compaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022; Diagnose and Expose the Root Causes: Research and collecting evidence to move beyond generic discussions of poverty to identify and publicly articulate the specific policies, power dynamics, and structural inequalities fueling the gap between the rich and the poor, and between regions. &#x2022; Build a Coalition for Action: Unite civil society, grassroots activists, academics, and principled policymakers into a powerful, evidence -based force capable of demanding and designing concrete alternatives. &#x2022; Amplify Marginalized Voices: Center the experiences and solutions of communities most affected by inequality youth, women, displaced persons, and marginalized regions ensuring they lead the advocacy for change. &#x2022; Advocate for Systemic Solutions: Drive the national policy agenda toward actionable reforms that promote equitable wealth distribution, fair taxation, transparent and accountable governance of resources, and investment in public services and dignified work that leaves no one behind.</narrative>
  </description>
